  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: MapaDeConceptos MPIMaritalStatusMap</b></p><a name=\"MPIMaritalStatusMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcMPIMaritalStatusMap\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl/fhir/ig/eis/0.2.1/ValueSet-eis-EstadoCivil-VS.html\">Estado Civil</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/valueset-marital-status.html\">MaritalStatus</a></p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl/fhir/ig/eis/0.2.1/CodeSystem-eis-EstadoCivil-CS.html\">Estado Civil</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-MaritalStatus.html\">MaritalStatus (version: 3.0.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>1 (Soltero/a)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>S (Never Married)</td></tr><tr><td>2 (Casado/a)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>M (Married)</td></tr><tr><td>3 (Viudo/a)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>W (Widowed)</td></tr><tr><td>4 (Divorciado/a)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>D (Divorced)</td></tr><tr><td>5 (Separado/a Judicialmente)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>A (Annulled)</td></tr><tr><td>6 (Conviviente (con acuerdo de unión civil))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>T (Domestic partner)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl/fhir/ig/eis/0.2.1/CodeSystem-eis-EstadoCivil-CS.html\">Estado Civil</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\">NullFlavor (version: 3.0.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>99 (Desconocido)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equal\" title=\"equal\">is equal to</a></td><td>UNK (Unknown)</td></tr></table></div>"
